# Cloudflare Pages _headers
# Place this file in your repo root — Cloudflare serves it automatically.
# Injects PHUL license notice into every HTTP response header.
#
# 09/09 LAUNCH HARDENING v0.1: added ordinary browser-hardening headers
# below the existing license block. These are conservative, well-tested
# defaults (no broad resource CSP — the site has inline CSS/JS and
# external media/forms that a strict CSP could break days before
# launch; only framing is restricted here). Cloudflare Pages applies
# this file automatically on deploy; it cannot be exercised by a plain
# local static server, so the actual response headers should be spot-
# checked once (e.g. curl -I) after the next deploy.

/*
  X-License: Personal-Human-Use-License-v1.0
  X-License-URL: https://emvycheck.com/LICENSE-PHUL.txt
  X-AI-Training: PROHIBITED
  X-Commercial-Use: PAID-LICENSE-REQUIRED
  X-Robots-Tag: noai, noimageai
  X-Content-Rights: Copyright-EMVY-CHECK-Michal-Veltrusky-All-Rights-Reserved
  X-Personal-Use: Permitted-for-individual-humans-only
  X-Contact: emvycheck@gmail.com
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
